<view class="page home-page"><view wx:if="{{nextPlan}}" class="hero-panel top-plan" style="margin-top:{{navHeight}}px" bindtap="openPlan"><view class="route-tag">我的下一次出发</view><view class="hero-title">{{nextPlan.route_snapshot.title}}</view><view class="hero-copy">{{nextPlan.status==='active'?'不用赶，照自己的节奏走。':nextPlan.status==='scheduled'?nextPlan.scheduled_at:'还没定下时间，也没关系。'}}</view><view class="facts">打开我的计划　→</view></view><view wx:else class="weekend-cover" style="padding-top:{{navHeight}}px"><image class="hero-photo" src="/assets/routes/tropical-palm.jpg" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="hero-photo-shade"/><view class="hero-aurora"/><view class="hero-petal petal-one"/><view class="hero-petal petal-two"/><view class="hero-petal petal-three"/><view class="orbit-emblem" aria-label="风里星球"><view class="emblem-planet"/><view class="emblem-ring"/><view class="emblem-star star-one">✦</view><view class="emblem-star star-two">✦</view></view><view class="cover-copy"><view class="cover-brand-row"><view class="brand">风里有约</view><view class="cover-city">北京⌄</view></view><view class="eyebrow">WEEKEND OUTING CLUB</view><view class="cover-title">让周末，<br/>长出一点意外。</view><view class="cover-text">选一条路线，走进光里。今天不用很厉害，只要愿意出发。</view></view></view><view class="top-actions"><button class="top-search" bindtap="goRoutes"><text>⌕</text> 搜路线</button><button class="top-community" bindtap="goCommunity"><text>＋</text> 加入北京风里有约群</button></view><button class="home-prompt" bindtap="goCreate"><text>现在还没有计划也没关系</text><b>我有半天，想出去透透气　→</b></button><view class="section mood-section"><view class="section-head"><view><text class="section-kicker">PICK A MOOD</text><view class="section-heading">今天想怎么过？</view></view><button class="text-link" bindtap="goRoutes">看全部</button></view><view class="moods"><button data-mood="all" bindtap="goMood"><text>✨</text>随便逛逛</button><button data-mood="culture" bindtap="goMood"><text>🖼️</text>看点东西</button><button data-mood="outdoor" bindtap="goMood"><text>🌿</text>出去走走</button><button data-mood="food" bindtap="goMood"><text>🍜</text>吃点好的</button></view></view><view class="section"><view class="section-head"><view><text class="section-kicker">FOR RIGHT NOW</text><view class="section-heading">离你不远，今天就能去</view></view><button class="text-link" bindtap="goRoutes">全部路线</button></view><block wx:if="{{route}}"><button class="route-card" bindtap="openRoute"><view class="route-cover home-visual"><image wx:if="{{route.cover}}" class="route-photo" src="{{route.cover}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="photo-shade"/><text class="route-tag">{{route.tag||'系统精选'}}</text><text class="source-badge {{route.source_type==='community'?'community':''}}">{{route.source_type==='community'?'大家分享':'系统精选'}}</text></view><view class="route-body"><view class="route-title">{{route.title}}</view><view class="route-desc">{{route.description}}</view><view class="facts">⌖ {{route.district}}　◷ {{route.duration}}　¥ {{route.budget}}</view></view></button></block><view wx:else class="empty">今天的路线正在准备中。</view></view><view class="section"><view class="section-head"><view><text class="section-kicker">GO TOGETHER</text><view class="section-heading">想和别人一起？</view></view><button class="text-link" bindtap="goInvites">全部　→</button></view><button wx:if="{{invitations.length}}" class="invite-card home-invite" bindtap="goInvites"><view class="status-pill">正在邀约</view><view><b>{{invitations[0].route.title}}</b><text>{{invitations[0].start_time}} · {{invitations[0].member_count}}/{{invitations[0].max_people}} 人</text><text>先看发起人主页，再决定是否同行　→</text></view></button><button wx:else class="empty" bindtap="goRoutes">暂时还没有合适的同行。<br/>自己去也很好，想一起时再发起邀约。</button></view><button class="record-card" bindtap="goRecord"><text>JUST FOR ME · 私密记录</text><b wx:if="{{latestRecord}}">{{latestRecord.body}}</b><b wx:else>给今天留一句话，不用完整，也不用马上写。</b><view>去记录　→</view></button></view>